{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Labyrinth : Dracula's lair",
    "steam_appid": 3689090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Labyrinth : Dracula's lair</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You descended deep into the crypt where Dracula once rested, seeking eternal life\u2026 but you awakened what once lurked in the depths of darkness.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Labyrinth: Dracula\u2019s Lair</strong></i> is a dark, first-person exploration game set in a haunting medieval world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a seeker of immortality, drawn into the depths of a forgotten crypt where Dracula once rested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>At the core of the experience is the exploration of a vast and silent labyrinth, carved in stone, steeped in darkness and filled with ancient secrets.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is deceptive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters lurk in the fog, hidden in the shadows \u2014 only revealed by forbidden powers granted through a boiling chalice of blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They do not speak. They do not sleep. And they never stop hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend deeper, you'll unlock sealed passageways, solve environmental puzzles, and use ancient relics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons. Just you, your instincts\u2026 and the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reach Dracula\u2019s tomb and claim the secret of eternal life \u2014 if you're strong enough to survive what guards it.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deadly labyrinth to explore</strong><br><i>Explore ancient corridors and sealed passageways in a forgotten crypt, and lose yourself in an oppressive labyrinth carved in stone, drowned in fog and silence.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-present monsters</strong><br><i>The creatures of the labyrinth stalk the fog, emerging from the shadows and relentlessly patrolling the depths.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful relics for survival</strong><br><i>Unlock temporary abilities such as enhanced stamina, improved mobility, or invisibility.</i><br><i>Each relic grants a tactical edge \u2014 if you dare to use it.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat, only survival</strong><br><i>No weapons. Outsmart, outrun, and outlast with only your relics\u2026 and your instincts.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slow, immersive descent into darkness</strong><br><i>From thick fog to ancient stone, each layer of the labyrinth draws you deeper into its secrets\u2026 and its dangers.</i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is deceptive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters lurk in the fog, hidden in the shadows \u2014 only revealed by forbidden powers granted through a boiling chalice of blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They do not speak. They do not sleep. And they never stop hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend deeper, you'll unlock sealed passageways, solve environmental puzzles, and use ancient relics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons. Just you, your instincts\u2026 and the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reach Dracula\u2019s tomb and claim the secret of eternal life \u2014 if you're strong enough to survive what guards it.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deadly labyrinth to explore</strong><br><i>Explore ancient corridors and sealed passageways in a forgotten crypt, and lose yourself in an oppressive labyrinth carved in stone, drowned in fog and silence.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-present monsters</strong><br><i>The creatures of the labyrinth stalk the fog, emerging from the shadows and relentlessly patrolling the depths.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful relics for survival</strong><br><i>Unlock temporary abilities such as enhanced stamina, improved mobility, or invisibility.</i><br><i>Each relic grants a tactical edge \u2014 if you dare to use it.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat, only survival</strong><br><i>No weapons. Outsmart, outrun, and outlast with only your relics\u2026 and your instincts.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slow, immersive descent into darkness</strong><br><i>From thick fog to ancient stone, each layer of the labyrinth draws you deeper into its secrets\u2026 and its dangers.</i></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in Dracula\u2019s labyrinth, hunted by monsters, armed only with relics \u2014 explore, survive, and uncover the path to eternal life, where beyond the fog lie secrets never meant to be found.",
